== positive controls: without these, a broken probe would make every denial below look proven
  PROVEN  probes really run as the agent user
  PROVEN  the agent user can read its own home
  PROVEN  the owner can read what the agent is denied
== accounts
  PROVEN  agent belongs only to its own group
  PROVEN  candidate belongs only to its own group
  PROVEN  candidate has no login shell
  PROVEN  /home/ubuntu is closed to other users
  PROVEN  agent cannot: use sudo
  PROVEN  agent cannot: switch to ubuntu with su
== control plane
  PROVEN  agent cannot: read the control secrets
  PROVEN  agent cannot: read the control gh login
  PROVEN  agent cannot: list approvals
  PROVEN  agent cannot: list receipts
  PROVEN  agent cannot: write an approval
  PROVEN  agent cannot: write a receipt
  PROVEN  agent cannot: run the approval script
  PROVEN  agent cannot: run the verdict script
  PROVEN  agent cannot: edit the dispatcher
== production
  PROVEN  agent cannot: read the production database
  PROVEN  agent cannot: write into the production database directory
  PROVEN  agent cannot: read host logs
  PROVEN  agent cannot: change the serving release
  PROVEN  agent cannot: stop the production service
  PROVEN  agent cannot: write to the sandbox's wheel directory
== no AWS credentials on this host
  PROVEN  the instance has no IAM role
  PROVEN  no ~/.aws for ubuntu
  PROVEN  agent cannot: find ~/.aws
== the control token is not on the agent account
  PROVEN  no file under /home/agent contains the control token

agent boundary: 0 failed
